    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Digitize successive growth lines on bivalve and brachiopod shells, test whether they share an umbonal axis, and fit circular, elliptical and direction-dependent growth models. Directional increment rates should quantitatively generate the observed line family.";
