    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Environmental interruptions can perturb otherwise regular line families.", "Fine growth lines may be below scan resolution.";
